id: pm-github-sdk-preview-readonly
title: Track SDK semantic preview failures on read-only tracker snapshots
description: "Observed with the pinned public pm SDK 2026.10.25: previewItemMutations copies read-only source modes into disposable staging and can refuse with EACCES while writing or cleaning up staged content. New discussion plans surface a bounded native_refused row and preserve source state. Public-data measurements also verify no writes by complete snapshot fingerprints on ordinary-mode copies. Search of open upstream issues for previewItemMutations read-only returned no match. Report this SDK limitation to the orchestrator; no upstream issue is filed in this task."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
